  "details": "In a recent update the texture cache was moved to the same custom path set for the content cache. However my content cache was set to a large slow hdd with lots of extra space, whereas it seems the texture cache needs to be on a fast SDD or performance suffers. My boot SDD is fast but doesn't have much free space. I would like to be able to set two different paths for the texture and content cache.",
